OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDoctors treat a bus driver with
OL,7,     Ffoot pain, while Dr Prestwich
OL,8,     Fhelps a girl with epilepsy who's
OL,9,     Fat risk of seizures when ill.
OL,10,     FAnother patient experiences
OL,11,     Fhallucinations from Parkinson's.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe hospital is in the middle of
OL,14,     Fone of the worst storms in
OL,15,     Fdecades, but that doesn't stop
OL,16,     Fcasualty being busy. It's not long
OL,17,     Fbefore paramedics bring in the
OL,18,     Fstorm's first victim.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/5
