OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia treats a 22 year-old
OL,7,     Fplumber with a cyst he's had since
OL,8,     Fadolescence, Dr Emma contends with
OL,9,     Fsome large crusty lesions and Dr
OL,10,     FAdil meets an audiologist covered
OL,11,     Fin lipomas.
OL,12,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,13,G     Death
OL,14,     FClaire has a tumour growing
OL,15,     Fbetween her brain and her nose.
OL,16,     FAnd if her surgeon can't mend the
OL,17,     Fhole he has to make in her skull
OL,18,     Fto get the tumour out, she risks
OL,19,     Fmeningitis.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/5
